                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For an account of the policy of the United States on fisheries and territorial
                    waters by William C. Herrington, Special Assistant for Fisheries and Wildlife,
                    to the Under Secretary of State, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, June 30, 1952, pages 1021–1023.</p>
